Lists the next batch of your topic's cards waiting for art: each card's titles, summary, body and subtopic, and its writer's request: its kind (a gag or an informative drawing), what the art should show, and ideas for drawing it. Cards still waiting for their first art come first; then cards whose art is an older style, marked Redraw, to draw again. It says how many more are waiting. While a new style is on trial, it lists only as many as the trial has left, and then none until the owner approves the style.
